on enterFrame me
  [  0] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <13>
  [  5] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(13)>
  [  8] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  9] setobjprop 57 ........................... sprite(13).visible = 0
  [ 12] ret
end
